                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened] creature misses the hobkins with a Strike</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> There is a creature other than the attacker within 15 feet that would be a valid target for the triggering attack</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The hobkins redirects the triggering attack to the required creature. The attacker rerolls the attack against the new target.</p>"
