                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Hobkins always levitate about an inch off the ground, ignoring difficult terrain unless it would also affect flying creatures. If they're further than an inch off the ground at the end of their turn, they gently fall to that height, without taking damage, unless they have something to hold on to.</p>"
