                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The hobkins is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The hobkins produces eerie lights and uncanny sounds with no clear source, attempting to [[/act demoralize]] a foe within 30 feet. Demoralizing this way loses the auditory trait, gains the visual trait, and doesn't cause the hobkins to lose the hidden condition. The hobkins takes no penalty to their check if the target cannot understand their language.</p>"
